Today, someone in #nethack (freenode) asked if eating a wand of
teleportation lead to teleportitis.

The answer is (of course) no, but it lead to me considering what would
happen if eating wands could lead to intrinsics.

A short list of possible effects:


enlightenment:
	Same as !oEnlightenment.

make invisible:
	Invisibility.

slow monster:
	Speed loss.

speed monster:
	Speed gain.

undead turning:
	Polymorph into a random undead creature (turns you into an
	undead).

cold:
	Cold damage, chance of fire resistance.

fire:
	Fire damage, chance of cold resistance.
	
sleep:
	Fall asleep.

polymorph:
	Same as !oPolymorph
	
death:
	Insta-Death.

cancellation:
	Lose one intrinsic (same as gremlin attack).

light:
	Same as !ofLevitation (makes you _light_).

teleportation:
	Teleportitis, chance of teleportation control if blessed.

lightning:
	shock damage, chance of shock resistance.

minor damage:
	magic missile, striking.

no effect:
	nothing.

small chance of max pw increase/pw increase:
	digging, locking, opening, probing, secret door detection, 
	create monster, wishing.

